leo park: Quick escape hatch note — onboarding with the Next + LangChain sample and we hit an auth/retry spiral on Edge (keeps retrying after 401).
anya: saw this too. Repro: deploy sample, call /api/chat, initial 401 due to token rotation, then SDK retries but second request missing Authorization header.
shiv: dug through @redwood/sdk-edge codepath — retry reconstructs Request but doesn't merge ephemeral headers. On some Edge runtimes those headers aren't preserved across clone.
kevin: filed infra ticket 3721 with a minimal repro. https://git.redwood/infra/issues/3721 
docsy-bot: Issue 3721 created by kevin  labels: sdk-edge, bug, repro
leo park: immediate mitigation for the starter: add a defensive helper that always sets Authorization explicitly before fetch. Will add snippet to README under "Edge gotchas" so users don't get blocked.
anya: helper snippet (works around SDK until fix lands):
```js
export async function authFetch(input, init = {}, token) {
  const baseReq = input instanceof Request ? input : new Request(input, init);
  const headers = new Headers(baseReq.headers || {});
  if (token) headers.set('authorization', `Bearer ${token}`);
  const body = baseReq.method === 'GET' ? undefined : await baseReq.clone().arrayBuffer();
  return fetch(new Request(baseReq.url, { method: baseReq.method, headers, body }));
}
```
shiv: I'll add a smoke e2e under samples that simulates expiring tokens and asserts at most 2 attempts. That should catch regressions in CI.
kevin: opened PR 3722 to the starter repo with helper + README note and a tiny test. Tagging @leo for review.
docsy-bot: PR 3722 created  reviewers: leo park, docs-team
leo park: reviewing now. Also adding a one-liner to the SE onboarding checklist: "If Edge starter hits repeated 401s, confirm authFetch present or upgrade sdk-edge."
anya: long-term: align sdk-edge retry behavior with sdk-js so headers are preserved and we can remove workaround. Filed follow-up task in infra board.
shiv: noted. For now the workaround + CI smoke should prevent new users from hitting this during demos.
leo park: thanks everyone — will merge hotfix once PR passes CI. :white_check_mark:
